<template id="search-by-ai-microphone-error-modal-template">
	<div class="js-searchByAiMicrophoneErrorModal">
		<div class="modal-sheet">
			<div class="modal-sheet__scrim"></div>
			<div class="modal-sheet__sheet">
				<div class="modal-sheet__handle">
					<span></span>
					<span></span>
				</div>
				<div class="modal-sheet__content">
					<button class="modal__close"></button>
					<div class="modal-sheet__data">
						<h2>El micr&#xF3;fono est&#xE1; desactivado</h2>
						<img src="https://statics.imghs.net//dist/img/microphone-error-desktop.png" ) class="u-hide u-show--s768" alt="" />
						<img src="https://statics.imghs.net//dist/img/microphone-error-mobile.png" ) class="u-hide--s768" alt="" />
						<p>Para utilizar esta funci&#xF3;n, habilita el micr&#xF3;fono desde la barra de direcciones del navegador.</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</template>

<template id="search-by-ai-loading-template">
